# geometry setup for the compute pace / pace/atom unit tests
# small, irregular (non-lattice), periodic H/N/O cell chosen so that atoms
# interact across the periodic boundaries -> ghost atoms are required, which
# exercises the local+ghost gradient/virial accumulation in compute pace.

units           metal
atom_style      atomic
atom_modify     map hash
boundary        p p p

read_data       ${input_dir}/data.pace-hno
